sequenceDiagram
  actor B as Buyer (Parent)
  participant API as MarketService
  participant BS as BillingService / Store
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant PO as payOS
  B->>API: POST /market/checkout {listingId}
  API->>DB: listing published and seller approved?
  alt own listing
    API-->>B: 422 This is your story
  else already owned
    API-->>B: 409 Already owned
  end
  API->>BS: checkoutOrder(item: listing, price, seller share snapshot)
  alt price = 0
    BS->>DB: order paid -> entitlement, freeClaimCount+1
  else price > 0
    BS->>PO: create payment link
    PO->>BS: webhook PAID
    BS->>DB: fulfillOrder -> entitlement, purchaseCount+1
    BS->>DB: recordEarning: earning_pending (available after hold days)
    opt entitlement already active (double order)
      BS->>DB: auto refund_request (duplicate purchase)
    end
  end
  B->>API: GET /market/owned -> add to child bookshelf
